---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/ui/Container.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'November 21, 2026';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="The terms governing your use of the Hossain Growth website and services."
>
  <section class="bg-ink-950 py-16 text-bone-50 lg:py-20">
    <Container class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <Breadcrumbs
        items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Terms & Conditions' }]}
        class="text-ink-400"
      />
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-ink-300">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20">
    <Container class="prose-content text-ink-800">
      <p>
        These Terms and Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of the Hossain Growth website located
        at hossaingrowth.com and any services described on it. By using our website, you agree to
        these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Use of our website</h2>
      <p>
        You may use our website to learn about our services, review our work, and contact us. You
        agree not to misuse the website, including attempting to gain unauthorized access to any
        part of it, submitting false information through our forms, or using automated means to
        extract data without our permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Services</h2>
      <p>
        Information on this website about our services is provided for general informational
        purposes. Specific service scope, deliverables, timelines, and fees for any engagement are
        governed by a separate signed agreement between Hossain Growth and the client, which takes
        precedence over any general description on this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, and design, is owned by
        Hossain Growth or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
        You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from this content without our
        prior written consent.
      </p>

      <h2>Portfolio and case study content</h2>
      <p>
        Client names, project details, and results referenced in our portfolio and case studies are
        shared with permission and reflect the specific context of each engagement. Results for any
        individual project are not a guarantee of results for future engagements.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may link to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content or
        practices of websites we do not control.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, Hossain Growth is not liable for any indirect,
        incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this website. This section
        does not limit liability arising under a separate signed service agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the website after changes are
        posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these Terms can be sent through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </Container>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
